Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.08,0:00:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, she's going to town on that bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:13.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know where she gets them,\Nbut she's been bringing them here to chew on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika! What on earth are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.71,0:00:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's very dusty under there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:24.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,540)}{\an7}Fry Friends
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.58,0:00:33.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,604.8)}{\an7}The Hindsight Bones and the Snowy Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.83,0:00:31.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,We ended up fishing a\Nwhole person's worth of bones
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:33.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,out from underneath my bed...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,N-now hold on!\NLaika doesn't eat people!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,She FOUND those!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you lying...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.42,0:00:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika tells the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,She might've nibbled on the bones...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.29,0:00:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guilty, eh? Turn yourself in!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.17,0:00:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This wasn't Laika's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The evidence says otherwise. Give it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:51.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,L-leave me alone, pudge muffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:53.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'll have you know that-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.50,0:00:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Boy, am I glad to be able to move again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:00:59.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,A skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.08,0:01:01.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-skeleton...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,...skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-skeleton...?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.92,0:01:05.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're monsters made of bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,When someone has unfinished business\Nor dies holding a deep-seated grudge,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,they're resurrected as an undead creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.38,0:01:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,In other words, this person is\Nalso from another world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.33,0:01:17.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Honeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.63,0:01:21.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now then, little miss doggie...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.88,Q3,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not a dog...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.88,0:01:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you putting my body\Nback together for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:25.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I appreciate you putting my body\Nback together for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.42,0:01:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,The gnawing was unnecessary,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.29,0:01:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,but collecting all of my bones\Nmust have been back-breaking work,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:33.79,Q3,,0,0,0,,Aw, who's a good girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.25,0:01:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,She seems kind of nice,\Ndon'tcha think?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:35.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,Aw, who's a good girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.79,0:01:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lighthearted... y'know,\Nbeing bones and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.21,Q3,,0,0,0,,You are! Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lighthearted... y'know,\Nbeing bones and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:40.04,Q3,,0,0,0,,You are! Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She doesn't exactly strike me as\Nsomeone who has a grudge...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, but I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.88,0:01:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You see, I was once a mage\Nin the service of a certain kingdom...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.83,0:01:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but one day, I was falsely\Naccused of treason
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.33,0:01:51.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,and hanged for my supposed crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.54,0:01:53.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I returned as a skeleton,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.54,0:01:57.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,and there was a doorway inside a dungeon\NI'd stumbled upon that led to this world...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the moment I arrived here...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.46,0:02:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got hit by a truck and shattered to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Woe is me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, bony!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But now that I can move again,\NI intend to enjoy this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.25,0:02:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really? Looking like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.92,0:02:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,O-oh, sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.63,0:02:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyone with eyes can see\Nthat I've gotten fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.54,0:02:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're a SKELETON!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.17,0:02:25.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it not obvious? Well, if I must...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.25,0:02:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sh-she's... using magic to\Ngive herself a body?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right on the money!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.63,0:02:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,And by the way, this body is a recreation\Nof what I looked like when I was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.63,0:02:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,See? My lower back is flabby...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.67,0:02:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm far too embarrassed\Nto go out in public like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.67,0:02:49.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And all I wanted was to enjoy this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, why not ask\NMr. Human for help?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is his area of expertise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:57.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd appreciate any assistance\Nyou can provide!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.67,0:03:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hm, it looks like your spine curves forward...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.96,0:03:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sometimes bad posture is\Nthe culprit behind stiff shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Slouching puts pressure on\Nyour internal organs,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.96,0:03:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,which can have negative consequences.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.63,0:03:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do skeletons even have organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cross my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.83,0:03:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,First, I'll teach you some effective\Nstretches for your lower back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you don't take the necessary precautions,\Nstrength training can make things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:27.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,The first step is to loosen up your muscles\Nwhile being mindful of your posture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:31.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just like that! Try and do these\Nexercises at least once a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This stuff is pretty difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.29,0:03:37.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll do it with you!\NWe'll give it our best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.29,0:03:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Laika, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is exciting!\NI'm more motivated than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What do you think?\NMy back looks nice and slim!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.33,0:03:56.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You did a great job getting in shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You'll be able to enjoy\Nthe human world now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.50,0:04:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, that's what I'd hoped...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,The magic disguising her skeleton...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.88,0:04:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,In retrospect, when I turned into a skeleton...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:14.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was alone for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:17.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Being alone makes you\Nreflect on a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.54,0:04:21.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pain, fear, sorrow, hatred...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:24.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The grief and the despair of\Nwondering why I alone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.21,0:04:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,was forced to suffer such a fate...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But those dark and dismal feelings...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.71,0:04:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They disappeared as I\Nspent time with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.25,0:04:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which is why I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,...exercising helped me enjoy my time here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.21,0:04:45.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can finally rest now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:54.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bony went bye-bye...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,So she was a fairy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.42,0:04:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We ought to give her a decent burial.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.08,0:05:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Weight loss is a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:03.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What lies beyond that is the important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.79,0:05:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.25,0:05:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted Honeda to enjoy life...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.67,0:05:10.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted more for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.50,0:05:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:14.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well then count me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,She spoke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.67,Q3,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.17,0:05:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your words stirred up more feelings\Nof regret, so I came back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.67,0:05:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your words stirred up more feelings\Nof regret, so I came back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.25,Q3,,0,0,0,,Oh jeez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your words stirred up more feelings\Nof regret, so I came back again!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.67,0:05:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Without that fleshy baggage,\Nthese old bones nearly gave up the ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.25,0:05:26.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,...I want a refund.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.25,0:05:30.21,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.71,0:05:29.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.25,0:05:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone's in a good mood 'cause of the snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.38,0:05:38.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are we walking in this kind of weather...?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.42,0:05:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think something fell out of your-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.13,0:05:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I use dried lizards for my sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.25,0:05:49.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, but why was it in your pocket?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:49.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sneak, sneak, sneak...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a saying in the human world:\NHope for the best, prepare for the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.29,0:05:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:59.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's not like lizards\Nfreak me out or anything-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.17,0:05:59.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lizard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine, I lied! I hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.58,0:06:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've hated reptiles ever since\Na snake bit me when I was a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:08.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't even look at them,\Nmuch less touch one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess the human isn't invincible after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,A little cliché, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time! I'd better get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,See ya! Don't wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,He ran away...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, we might as well finish our walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm going home! It's freezing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:27.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You moron.\NThis is the perfect kind of day for-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.42,0:06:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oof!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.08,0:06:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Owie...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's a person under there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.29,0:06:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,We have to help them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We got her out of those\Nwet clothes, but, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.08,0:06:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:43.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,So she's just sleeping?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.92,0:06:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What was she doing\Nunderneath all that snow...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, she's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You two are elves...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:06:59.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.25,0:07:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did she just... talk inside my head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragons are capable of wielding\Nhigher forms of sorcery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:08.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,To someone like her,\Ntelepathy is small potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wanna eat beef... Wanna lose weight...\NHungry, want food...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.13,0:07:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems like we're catching\Nher excess thoughts...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyway, how did you end up\Nburied in the snow?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.25,0:07:20.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I believe it was after lunchtime.\NI was on a walk...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:23.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,but then I fell prey to drowsiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.29,0:07:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why bother when it's snowing outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.92,Q3,,0,0,0,,To lose weight, duh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.29,0:07:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,To lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.54,0:07:32.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, I never knew dragons\Ncould be so rotund!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come again, little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.50,0:07:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop that! You're going to piss her off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.17,0:07:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Haven't you ever heard of\Na dragon's treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'mean all the stuff they hoard\Nand stand guard over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.50,Q3,,0,0,0,,I'm starving... Wanna eat meat...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.38,0:07:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y'mean all the stuff they hoard\Nand stand guard over?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we get the human to help\Nthe dragon lose weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.79,0:07:49.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,there might be cash in our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.83,0:07:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could reduce my hours at the corner store!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.04,0:07:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Treasure doesn't really interest me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.17,0:07:55.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,All-you-can-eat French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'LL DO IT!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.21,0:07:58.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You wish to lose weight, dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.71,0:08:02.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where'd that come from?\NBut yes, I suppose so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:04.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's only one man who can make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.33,0:08:06.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? And who would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's known as...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Dragon Slenderer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Gonda.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.92,0:08:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you. I'm Naoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:18.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why did we have to hide her tail?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.42,0:08:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice!\NShe looks way too much like a reptile.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We absolutely cannot let him find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.88,0:08:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Strange. I hadn't expected the\NDragon Slenderer to be so young...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? Dra-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.54,0:08:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's not waste valuable time!\NGo ahead and hear her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! It's not like she's a dragon or anyth-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.00,0:08:37.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep your big mouth shut, wouldja?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.75,0:08:42.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll start by examining you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.46,0:08:45.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you're freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your skin feels like a block of ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't lose weight if I'm cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not that.\NYou could develop hypothermia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:54.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need to warm you up first!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.79,0:08:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Calm down, human.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lizards are cold-blooded animals.\NEven if they-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.79,0:09:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good idea! I'll go make her a hot drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,The cold breeds all sorts of illnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make sure your body stays warm in order\Nto avoid a weakened immune system
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,as well as tension and swelling\Ncaused by poor blood circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.04,0:09:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.50,0:09:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She has a forked-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:19.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's extremely rude to stare, y'know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Much warmer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.00,0:09:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:26.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, on to the main issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are there any specific areas of your body\Nthat you'd like to focus on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.13,0:09:33.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to lose weight\Naround my belly and my hips.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,My belly gets in the way\Nwhen I walk on all fours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.21,0:09:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,All fours...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.42,0:09:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-this one's got a four-digit weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's rich coming from\Nthe lard-ass elf herself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:44.42,Q3,,0,0,0,,Zip it, butterball! Can you not\Ncause problems for like five seconds?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.21,0:09:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ladies, enough with the bickering!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm going to teach you some exercises\Nthat tighten the waistline,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,so let's do them together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.75,0:09:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,He doesn't suspect a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can tone your waist by engaging\Nthe muscles around your stomach and hips.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But this type of activity\Nis taxing on the body,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.04,0:10:01.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,so some people have\Na tough time sticking with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.92,0:10:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why\NI recommend arm swinging!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:07.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hip rolling exercises are a great option, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is fairly difficult...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.29,0:10:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to do the same amount\Nin the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.79,0:10:20.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human! Y-yeah, uh, about that...!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.25,0:10:22.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Human...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We lost him...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The human suffered, but we were successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.08,0:10:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Remain consistent with these exercises\Nand you're guaranteed to lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Such is the wisdom of the Dragon Slenderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That deserves recognition, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So that's how it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright, fine. I concede.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:50.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Riches I collected here in the human world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.38,0:10:55.13,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,64.8)}{\an7}Dragon Gems
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.46,0:10:51.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep them safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.83,0:10:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's her precious treasure...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.83,0:10:55.13,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,108)}{\an7}Pretty marbles used to decorate\N{\pos(102.4,144)}{\an7}the top of a toilet sink basin
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.29,0:10:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Dragon Slenderer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.04,0:10:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,How much are these worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.71,0:11:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,...they're priceless.
